title    A100
about    Boogie for the Stadtautobahn with the windows down. Two guitars chugging a shuffle in E, one either side, a lead that sings the verse and bends through the solo, cowbell in the chorus.
at       autoradio
tempo    126
beats    4
steps    4
swing    0.18
reverb   0.2

# A twelve-bar in E: four bars of E, two of A, two of E, then B, A, E, B.
voice gtrL  drive    vol=0.5  pan=-0.45 gate=0.8 bright=0.8
voice gtrR  drive    vol=0.45 pan=0.45  gate=0.8 bright=0.9
voice lead  drive    vol=0.6  pan=0.1   glide=0.06
voice organ organ    vol=0.3  pan=0.2   center=E4
voice bass  ebass    vol=0.9
voice kick  kick     vol=0.85
voice snare snare    vol=0.6
voice hat   hat      vol=0.35 pan=0.2
voice ohat  ohat     vol=0.3  pan=0.2
voice crash crash    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice bell  cowbell  vol=0.3  pan=0.3
voice tom   tommid   vol=0.5  pan=-0.15

